{"title": "Sarin's Skull", "pageid": 18008, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sarin's_Skull", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Skull_A_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp/300px-Skull_A_Icon.webp, /w/images/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Sarin's Skull image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp/300px-Skull_A_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Sarin's Skull</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Quest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quest\">quest</a> item.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This skull was not subject to decay, but stripped clean of flesh entirely. Only the faintest of scorch-marks mar the otherwise gleaming bone: a sign of great care, or perhaps even reverence.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a pouch, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">Undercity Ruins</a>, behind <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bareki\" title=\"Bareki\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png/25px-Portrait_Bareki.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png/38px-Portrait_Bareki.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png/50px-Portrait_Bareki.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Voiceless Penitent Bareki\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png/25px-Portrait_Bareki.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bareki\" title=\"Bareki\">Voiceless Penitent Bareki</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-156&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;946</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be attached to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarin\" title=\"Sarin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Sarin.png/25px-Portrait_Sarin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Sarin.png/38px-Portrait_Sarin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Sarin.png/50px-Portrait_Sarin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sarin's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Sarin.png/25px-Portrait_Sarin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Portrait_Sarin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sarin\" title=\"Sarin\">Sarin's</a> skeleton inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City_Sewers\" title=\"Lower City Sewers\">Lower City Sewers</a></li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201506\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1545/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15085/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4367/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 818154/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expans